  "bounds_why": "the shell, two thick all round: x4568..4605 (interior 4570..4603), z2456..2494 (interior 2458..2492), y98..109 (floor y100, air 101..107, roof 108..109). Inside the gym_koga zone [4568, 2456, 4607, 2495] (40 x 40) on every side. The top course y109 leaves y110 and y111 natural under the Reed House's lowest course (the flue's sump, y112): COVER = 2.",
  "through_building": [
