      ],
      "why": "the stair tower: its walls x4598..4603 and z2487..2492 from y99 up to the watch floor's deck (y131), the ring x4599..4602 x z2488..2491, and the headroom over the first treads up to y134. It stands in the flood hall's south-east corner, which is open air over water (the building's model: air above the one block of water at y116, mud-brick walls on the east and south). The watch floor's deck at y131 is the building's; the arena opens it only over the first treads."
    }
  ],
