    "why": "route_end is one over Koga's spawner (4594, 131, 2487) on the watch floor, where the puzzle route ends (data/gym_buildings/gym5.json step 6 'koga'). The deck runs east to the stair head at (4599, 131, 2490); the stair winds down four turns (31 levels) and lets the player out of the tower's west door onto lane 1 at (4597, 101, 2488), 29 from Koga: farther than rctmod's forceBattleMaxDistance + 1, so the player is on the range before he can call the fight."
